{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"六年春王正月，王人子突救衛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"夏六月，衛侯朔入于衛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"秋，公至自伐衛。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"螟。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"冬，齊人來歸衛俘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"六年春，王人救衛。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"夏，衛侯入，放公子黔牟于周，放甯跪于秦，殺左公子洩、右公子職，乃即位。君子以二公子之立黔牟為不度矣。夫能固位者，必度於本末，而後立衷焉。不知其本，不謀；知本之不枝，弗強。《詩》云：「本枝百世。」","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"冬，齊人來歸衛寶，文姜請之也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_35_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_35","textTraditional":"楚文王伐申，過鄧。鄧祁侯曰：「吾甥也。」止而享之。騅甥、聃甥、養甥請殺楚子，鄧侯弗許。三甥曰：「亡鄧國者，必此人也。若不早圖，後君噬齊。其及圖之乎？圖之，此為時矣。」鄧侯曰：「人將不食吾餘。」對曰：「若不從三臣，抑社稷實不血食，而君焉取餘？」弗從。還年，楚子伐鄧。十六年，楚復伐鄧，滅之。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}